!-   ===========  PERFORMANCE CURVES  ===========

  Curve:Biquadratic,
    Chiller CapFT,           !- Name
    1.0,                     !- Coefficient1 Constant
    0.03,                    !- Coefficient2 x
    0.0,                     !- Coefficient3 x**2
    -0.003,                  !- Coefficient4 y
    0.0,                     !- Coefficient5 y**2
    0.0,                     !- Coefficient6 x*y
    4,                       !- Minimum Value of x
    12,                      !- Maximum Value of x
    20,                      !- Minimum Value of y
    40;                      !- Maximum Value of y

